  <jpigp_cor:NotesTradeReceivables2ConsolidatedFinancialStatementsIFRSTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearDuration">
&lt;p style="margin-left: 48px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;7.　売上債権&lt;/p&gt;
